  "worked_solution": "Since the vertical line should pass through $(1,4)$, the $x$-value for every point on the line is $1.$ Hence, the equation of that line is $x=1.$\n\nSince the horizontal line should pass through $(1,4)$, the $y$-value for every point on the line is $4.$ Hence, the equation of that line is $y=4.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14166027/assets/16e33da178489ccfc16b3e4cef5632d95df18b50ece5ae859f666120827da929.png)",
